    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1930625400469627268",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1930625400469627268",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1930625400469627268",
      "text": "[2:51PM] #Alausa_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nLateef Jakande Way is currently experiencing heavy traffic. This congestion is a spillover from the Kara and Beggar axis, likely exacerbated by the ongoing Ileya festive period. However, traffic management is actively addressing the situation.\n\nMeanwhile, Awolowo Way is good from the Shopping Mall and Coca-Cola Junction. As traffic approaches Allen Junction, it becomes busy due to alternation. From Allen Junction inward Olowu, traffic is moving fast, though the section from Olowu Junction to underneath the bridge is also busy due to the same alternation.\n\nTraffic at Old Tollgate, 7up, BillingsWay through to the intersection is good to go. Similarly, Dr. Nurudeen Olowopopo down to the Otedola underpass is also experiencing smooth traffic flow.\nLastly, Allen Junction inward Aromire, Akora Villa through to Akko is currently busy. Our officers are present at various key locations ensuring ease of movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
